on-arrival: {! var s=0; for(var i=1;i<=5;i++){ if(!Q['col'+i+'_zona']){s=i;break;} } if(s){ Q['col'+s+'_zona']="oaxaca"; Q['col'+s+'_nombre']="Col. del Istmo"; Q.pres_oaxaca=(Q.pres_oaxaca||0)+8; Q.columnas_formadas=1; } Q.parque-=2; Q.moral_columnas+=2; Q.expediente+=2; !}

On the Isthmus the column rises in Zapotec, half of it already organized by the assemblies before you arrived. It is the best water in the Republic and the army knows exactly which towns to punish for it. The dot is on the map.

- @root: Continuar.

@lev_valle
